abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact finite native-to-complex C3 crosswalk,
  the fifth-order oriented boundary jet, corrected velocity and acceleration,
  the stationary equation, and the certified promotion from C3 localization
  enclosures to a unique stationary-root family.
